post-it: None
symptoms:
	Blood comes out of the chassi
	Sound of heartbeat from computer
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Remove the faulty parts, throw them in the trash
	Get new parts from storage
	Install the parts
	Remount the shell
notes:
	Broken part: Motherboard, CPU, Fan, GPU and Hard drive
	Blood comes out of the chassi (discreet)
	Hardware replaced with customers organs (kidneys (RAM), heart (motherboard), lungs (fan), liver (GPU), brain (hard drive), spleen (CPU)). Note: Don't show the corrupted symptoms in CompuFun db. Treat likemissing/broken hardware with the symptoms.
	Blood comes out of the chassi: as he sets the computer down, blood seeps out under it, and stays on the counter for the rest of the game.
	Sound of heartbeat from computer: a heartbeat sounds from the computer while the heart is in it.
